 Other Content","notes":"Compared to leading brands"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Clinically studied multivitamin with 1,600 IU of vitamin D-3"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"GNC Mega Men(R) Performance & Vitality VITAPAK(R) Program is physician endorsed by Frank J. Costa, M.D., an internationally acclaimed urological surgeon, men's health expert and member of the GNC Medical Advisory Board.\n\"The Mega Men\u00ae Performance & Vitality Vitapak(R) Program is the best program available to address the performance needs of men, and I highly recommend it for those who seek comprehension nutritional support. GNC has utilized the finest formulas to support heart health, prostate function and vitality, plus a healthy balance of vitamins and minerals for overall wellness.\" - Frank J. Costa, M.D.\n"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"CONTAINS: Fish and Soybeans."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"CONTAINS: Fish and Soybeans."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Each pack contains:"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Mega Men(R) - This clinically studied, powerful multivitamin without iron supports overall health and wellness. It includes a potent complex of B-vitamins which are essential for metabolism support and energy production.*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"In a random, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 112 healthy volunteers, subjects taking the GNC vitamin ad mineral blend in this product for six weeks experienced statistically significant improvements in markers of B vitamin and antioxidant status, as well as improvements in SF-36 Vitality and Mental Health scores compared to those taking a placebo.\n"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"PHYSICIAN ENDORSED"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Performance"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Lutemax(TM) Lutein & Zeaxanthin 2020\nLutemax 2020(TM) is a trademark of OmniActive Health Technologies."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"WARNING: Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication, or have a medical condition.\n"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Discontinue use two weeks prior to surgery."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"To ensure a complete nutritional program, take daily with these GNC products:\n~ GNC Protein\n~ Ultra Probiotic Complex 25\n~ CoQ-10\n~ SuperFoods Whole Foods Blend"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"GNC QUALITY COMMITMENT For more than 77 years, GNC has been the leader in the development of superior nutritional supplements. Our products are produced using only fresh, high-quality ingredients and are manufactured under the strictest quality controls."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"GNC GUARANTEE If you are not 100% completely satisfied, return the unused portion of the product with your receipt to a GNC store within 30 days. Our trained sales staff will either refund your purchase price or, if you prefer, assist you in finding a replacement product to help you LIVE WELL."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"KEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"{ACTUAL SIZE}"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No Artificial Colors, No Wheat, No Dairy, Yeast Free."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"VITAPAK(R) PROGRAM FOR AN ACTIVE LIFESTYLE"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Why Should I Use Mega Men(R) Performance & Vitality Vitapak(R) Program? Mega Men(R) Performance & Vitality Vitapak(R) Program is specially formulated to address the performance needs of men. The components in this program not only support overall wellness, but also help support heart health, prostate function and vitality.* How Can Mega Men\u00ae Performance & Vitality Vitapak(R) Program Benefit Me? Mega Men(R) Performance & Vitality Vitapak(R) Program combines important nutrients that support your overall nutritional needs with focused ingredients designed to support men's heart health, prostate health and vitality in one convenient daily pack. How Does Mega Men(R) Performance & Vitality Vitapak(R) Program Work? Mega Men(R) Performance & Vitality Vitapak(R) Program includes the following components to help you achieve your daily nutritional goals:\n"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Mega Men(R)"}],"targetGroups":["Adult Male (18-50 Years)","Dairy Free"],"thumbnail":"","upcSku":"","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}